QFenix source provenance
========================
Source: https://github.com/iamromulan/qfenix.git
Pinned local research checkout:
  research/ckb01-pcie-edl-20261023/qfenix
Commit: 318a49cee9663a6a79fbcc8b44db8a3d2afdec2b

sha2.c and sha2.h are copied unchanged from this source, retaining their original
Aaron D. Gifford / OpenBSD attribution. LICENSE.qfenix is the upstream BSD-3-Clause
license. ckb01-firehose-read.c adapts only Firehose configure, getstorageinfo,
read command syntax and the NAND MIBIB/SMEM layout from firehose.c and gpt.c.

The transport is independently bounded poll/read/write on an existing mainline
WWAN character device. There is no USB, Sahara, BHI ioctl, programmer upload,
raw XML input, erase, program, patch, power, reset or automatic resume path.
Only configure, getstorageinfo and read XML commands can be emitted.
